  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support activities and projects directed to urban rehabilitation and requalification integrating the Recife rehabilitation of central areas Program. The interventions financed by this operation can be classified in three different groups: housing; requalification of public spaces and urban revitalization of main avenues of the city centre; and institutional strengthening, including in particular the establishment of a public-private entity to rehabilitation of central areas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
